$ choices --help
usage: choices [--level value] [--scheme value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Optional switches:
  --level value, -l value
      choices: 1, 3, 5
      default value 1
      Verbosity level
  --scheme value
      choices: weno5, muscl
      default value muscl
      Space scheme
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version, -v
      Print version
